  {
   "id": "dnf-duel-142063@1.03",
   "gameId": "dnf-duel-142063",
   "displayName": "Update 1.03",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-07-21T02:30:30.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Greetings DNF Duel Adventurers!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The following changes have been made in today’s Ver1.03 patch.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Character Skills",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Airwalk: Changed the skill's gravity upon its activation.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Break Down: Enlarged the downward hitbox of the attack, enabling it to hit crouching Enchantresses.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sacred Upper: Fixed an issue where the slamming attack could hit downed opponents repeatedly in some situations.: [The Lost Warrior]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Mysterious Pierce: Fixed an issue where the skill’s projectiles would not interact properly with other projectiles.: Training Mode",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where recording actions for training dummies while using customized button settings would cause dummies to replay unregistered actions.: Online Mode",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where players would be disconnected when starting Round 2 in online matches while using a keyboard. The end-of-round scene can be skipped with keys allocated to attacks.: We are also currently looking into other issues such as character balance, rematch bugs, non-registering button inputs, and more.: We will notify our Adventurers through a notice on patch dates for the issues just mentioned as soon as they are finalized.: We apologize for the inconveniences due to these issues.: Thank you.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
